<title>USA: Bonneville Wed power offers unchanged from Tues.</title>
<headline>Bonneville Wed power offers unchanged from Tues.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bonneville Power Administration (BPA) left next-day power offers unchanged, the agency said Tuesday.</p>
<p>BPA continued to offer firm power during off-peak hours at $9.00 per megawatt hour (MWh) for both Northwest and California-Oregon border (COB) deliveries.</p>
<p>BPA also offered non-firm power at $9.00 per MWh during hours ending 0100-0500 and 2400 PDT and at $9.50 for hours ending 0600 and 2300 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((--Los Angeles bureau +1 213 622 0056))</p>
</text>
